Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.

cwtone and CW Player are modified/reimplemented versions, not the original
cwwav. Changes include a Rust rewrite of the timing and PCM renderer, a
streaming WebAssembly ABI, browser playback, MP3 export and a progressive web
app. The first public version was published in 2026.

Bundled texts
"På ski over Grønland" by Fridtjof Nansen (1928) is in the public domain. The
bundled OCR text is from the National Library of Norway's "Public Domain Texts
from NBdigital" corpus in Språkbanken, released under CC0 1.0:
https://www.nb.no/sprakbanken/ressurskatalog/en/oai-nb-no-sbr-34/

